# Paint splats: the superpixel cells one shot paints, relative to the tank.
#
# Legend:  T  the tank's 6x6-superpixel footprint (reference only, must be a
#             6x6 block)
#          *  a cell the splat paints (exactly 16 per splat)
#          .  empty
#
# Each grid is in superpixels (2x2 pixels), not pixels. Splats may be messy
# and need not be symmetric, but no painted cell may touch the footprint (a
# one-cell gap separates tank and splat). Successive shots cycle through the
# variants in order.
#
# Only facings E and NE are drawn; the other six are exact quarter turns about
# the footprint's centre. Preview with:
#     uv run dd-preview-splats     (writes build/design/splats.png)


E 1
................
